@ Index:    Logarithmic spiral plot program
@ Author:   Jaco Mostert, RAprism, barrymead
@ Version:  5
@ Created:  2024-12-27
@ Modified: 2026-06-06
@ Source:   https://forum.swissmicros.com/viewtopic.php?p=35422#p35422
@ Tested:   Draws a logarithmic spiral (defaults scale 0.35, growth 0.1).
@ Input:    none; I=0 and J=0 take the defaults 0.35 and 0.1
@ Output:   Spiral on-screen
@
@ REG I: 0 or SCALING FACTOR
@ REG J: 0 or GROWTH RATE
@
@ Complex and do not change to RAD by RAprism
@
@ Changed to limit |x| to 150 instead of 234 by barrymead
@
@ Press-any-key and negative prevention added by JM
LBL ‘SPIRALk’
  ENTER
  RCL I
  𝑥=? 0.
    0.35
  STO I
  RCL J
  𝑥=? 0.
    0.1
  |𝑥|
  STO J
  LocR 02
  1
  STO R.00
  0
  ENTER
  CLLCDxy

  # MAIN LOOP START
  LBL :LOOP1:
    # CALC ANGLE
    RCL R.00
    500.
    ÷
    ENTER
    ⇒RAD
    ENTER

    # CALC RE IM
    cos(𝑥)
    𝑥⇄𝑦
    sin(𝑥)
    COMPLEX
    𝑥⇄𝑦

    # CALC SIZE
    RCL× J
    𝑒ˣ
    RCL× I

    # CHECK COMPLEX VECTOR SIZE
    150
    𝑥≤? Y
      GTO :EXIT:
    DROP𝑥
    STO R.01
    ×

    # PLOT POINTS
    # ADD OFFSET TO HAVE 0,0 IN MID OF SCREEN
    200.+120.𝒾
    +
    COMPLEX
    𝑥≤-0?
      GTO :BYPASS:
    𝑥⇄𝑦
    𝑥≤-0?
      GTO :BYPASS:
    SF ‘IGN1ER’
    POINT
    CF ‘IGN1ER’
    PAUSE 00

    LBL :BYPASS:
      # CALC NEXT ANGLE COUNTER
      RCL R.01
      1/𝑥
      SDL 03
      IP
      INCR X
      STO+ R.00
      GTO :LOOP1:

    LBL :EXIT:
      # WAIT FOR A KEY
      PAUSE 99
  END
.END.
